塗<rt>롷터-</rt></ruby><ruby>時<rt>시ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>定<rt>댤-</rt></ruby><ruby>八分<rt>뵣ˆ훈-</rt></ruby><ruby>命<rt>먀ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    loh-thor-sí tia̰-poêh-hun-miā\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>三分<rt>살ˉ훈ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>贏<rt>얄ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>애<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby><ruby>七分<rt>칟ˆ훈ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>拚<rt>뱔</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    sā̰-hūn-yá̰ ài-chît-hūn-pia̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>人情<rt>띤졩ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>冷暖<rt>롕ˆ롼ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>只<rt>지ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>陪伴<rt>붸퐐ˉ</rt></ruby>’꽈\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    rin-jiéng liêng-loàn jî-u-lì pue-phoā̰’goa\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>寒冬<rt>한당ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>也<rt>야-</rt></ruby><ruby>會<rt>에-</rt></ruby><ruby>溫暖<rt>운ˉ롼ˋ</rt></ruby>’꽈\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    han-tâng ya-e-ūn-loàn’goa\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>雙手<rt>샹ˉ츄ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>牽<rt>칸ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>也<rt>야-</rt></ruby><ruby>牽<rt>칸ˆ</rt></ruby>’됴꽈\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    u-lì’e siāng-chiù khân ya-khân’tio-goa\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>坎坎刻刻<rt>캄ˆ캄ˆ켹ˆ켹</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>路<rt>러ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>也<rt>야-</rt></ruby><ruby>會<rt>에-</rt></ruby><ruby>變<rt>볜ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>好<rt>호ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>行<rt>걀ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    khâm-khâm-khiêk-khiek’e lōr ya-e-pièn-hô-kiá̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>心肝<rt>심ˉ괄ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>向<rt>형</rt></ruby> <ruby>也<rt>야-</rt></ruby><ruby>向<rt>형</rt></ruby>’됴꽈\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\